Changelog & And later additions
V1.7.0 : Added Hades, a hot jupiter bigger than its star (M-type Copernicus), although it has less gravity.
V1.7.5 Added Quadruplet (or called four otherwise) star system, Zelda, will have no exoplanets at first, also added Veylon, a rogue neptune sized planet, will have rings later.
1.8.0 (later) : Visual Enhancing & Day cycles.
V1.8.5 (later) : Ice giant orbiting one of Zeldas star.
V1.9.0 (later) : 1 new star system and a nebula.
V1.9.5 (later) Quasar eating a A-type star, with a hot jupiter circumbinarily orbiting around them.
V2.0.0 (Later, last) : Dwarf galaxy, with small black hole, and total visual enhancing.
